{
  "key": 22820,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00000",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Ready? You know I will\nnot go easy.\rYou did not come all this way to\nbe handed a Badge."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00001",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: You earned that. Every\nbit of it.\rI am proud of you. Take the\nMarsh Badge, challenger."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Marsh Badge!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00003",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: There is one more\nthing. You deserve this TM, too."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: It contains Skill Swap!\n",
        "It swaps Abilities between the user\f",
        "and the target.\r",
        "You will become a celebrated and\n",
        "beloved Champion!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: Your love for your Pokémon\n",
        "smashed my psychic abilities...\r",
        "The ability to love, I think, is some\n",
        "kind of psychic ability..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo, legend in the making!\r",
        "A Trainer as skilled as you doesn’t\n",
        "need to be told how to deal\f",
        "with Psychic-type Pokémon, right?\r",
        "I expect great things from you!\r",
        "Good luck!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00007",
      "en_US": "That was another fantastic battle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00008",
      "en_US": "Saffron City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron City Pokémon Gym\r",
        "Leader: Sabrina\n",
        "Certified Trainer!\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
